  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8c5f8bea1b438d4687ad9b712e77c3e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 1-13 Starting Cutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  line:
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: I then told Doctor Regidor that I would leave England. I gave him a
      parting gift, a clay medallion showing profiles of the three sisters. With
      a heavy heart, saying my good-byes to the number of young Filipinos around
      me. I left England to go to Paris.
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: I frequently visited the home of the two doctors Pardo de Tevara, sons
      of the exile. They gave me company, and I enjoyed talking to them. On Sundays,
      I fenced with Juan Luna at his house.
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: I went back and forth to different places, such as Madrid, to seek
      justice for the injustice done to my family by General Weyler. Who had destroyed
      our home with no warning, whatsoever. After the landlords kept raising the
      rent on our house in Calamba due to a turkey not being provided to them.
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 5
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: 'Eventually, I made my way to work on the sequel of my first novel,
      "Noli Me Tangere", and now "El Filibusterismo". After a while, it is complete.
      My second novel, "El Filibusterismo". '
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 4
